
# SHADOW SURVIVOR

A 3D Open-World Survival Game.

## About the Project

SHADOW SURVIVOR is a survival game project focused on:

- Open-world exploration
- Human characters
- Story missions
- Survival gameplay
- Realistic environments
- Android and PC platforms

## Development Engine

Godot Engine 4.7

## Platforms

- Android
- PC

## Project Status

Early Starter Prototype.

This project is under development. Advanced graphics, realistic character models, animations, vehicles and missions are planned for future development.

## Developer

SHADOW SURVIVOR Development Project
